11/17/2025 DBB
This is a version that was used with the TSC code. It allowed for detection of zero
RF power and time programming of power and aiming angle from parameters in the .config file.
Since TSC is no longer used, and there has been no recent call for such programming
I have reverted to a simpler version and stripped that coding out.  This is the version 
that has the time programming.  Also there is a config file that has time programming
parameters for an ITER case with 5 launchers, from an old run set up for Francesca Poli.

